1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,900
Man: Hi, Anna. Do you happen to know

2
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:09,080
whether the library is staying open late tonight?

3
00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:12,260
I heard there might be a schedule change due to the maintenance work.

4
00:00:12,260 --> 00:00:17,070
Woman: Actually, yes, it's still open until 10 p. m. on weekdays.

5
00:00:17,070 --> 00:00:23,000
Even during the renovations, they've just relocated the study areas to the east wing temporarily.

6
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,780
Man: That's a relief. I've got a big exam tomorrow

7
00:00:25,780 --> 00:00:28,533
and I really need a quiet place to focus.

8
00:00:28,533 --> 00:00:30,280
My apartment is too noisy lately.

9
00:00:30,280 --> 00:00:33,566
Woman: I get that. Just make sure you pace yourself,

10
00:00:33,566 --> 00:00:37,180
take breaks so you don't burn out. Studying nonstop can backfire.
